    "sections": {
        "description": "The Optical Store theme is designed for businesses related to eye care, eyewear products, and vision services. It includes structured layouts for product displays, service sections, appointment details, testimonials, and contact information. The responsive design helps the website function smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options allow adjustments to colors, typography, banners, and page layouts while maintaining a clean and professional appearance. The theme also supports image galleries, blog sections, and product showcase areas for presenting eyeglasses, lenses, and optical accessories clearly. Suitable for an optician shop, optics store, eye clinic, or eyewear retailer, the layout provides a practical framework for sharing information about eye doctor consultations, optometrist services, glasses collections, and vision care solutions in an organized and accessible format."
    },
